robopi-analyze (1.0.2-1) stable; urgency=medium

  * Parse can-details.jsonl as a JSON object stream: records span two lines,
    so the line-based reader silently dropped every sample.
  * Drop events stamped outside the session window: dmesg --follow replays the
    whole kernel ring buffer, surfacing boot-time messages as capture-time faults.
  * Stop inference screen logging when the capture ends, so a finished session
    directory stops growing.


